      "id": "claim_4e9723f37ce7409e94df15645da62db6",
      "statement": "CachingChatModel keys the cache by chatRequest.messages().toString(); line-ending normalization is not done by the chat code but inside the cache key layer, where ChatCacheKey.of derives localKey via KeyGenerator.generateKey (CRLF normalized to LF before the content UUID is computed).",
