      "statement": "ChatModelUtils.nCachedRequest throws IllegalArgumentException when numberOfRequests is less than 1 and builds its cache key as numberOfRequests + \" results: \\n\" + request, with the count prefix separating multi-result entries from single-result ones stored via cachedRequest.",
